<Table class="oracle.dbtools.crest.model.design.relational.Table" directorySegmentName="seg_0" id="949CAF85-0834-90EC-7045-DA386E53935A" name="t_net_qso">
<createdBy>tcollier</createdBy>
<createdTime>2024-02-08 23:41:26 UTC</createdTime>
<commentInRDBMS><![CDATA[HARC SNN QSO Information is the base table.  It contains the checkin information (a primary key, the callsign, a contest id, and the first and last names.) for all contacts over all occurances of the net.  It is the primary source of information for the rest of the system.  The callout roster, for example, is generated from this entity.]]></commentInRDBMS>
